#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:5
#: ee55d597c92949c78e450bd23a8e2f52
msgid "Mission Planner Flight Data Screen"
msgstr "Mission Planner 飞行数据界面"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:7
#: 9bcd112eceb64cf9a50ac52a8deb0a41
msgid ""
"This section covers the information you will need to use the features in the"
" Mission Planner Flight DATA screen - selected in the Top menu of Mission "
"Planner. :ref:`An Introduction <mission-planner-ground-control-station>` "
"provides a brief overview with pointers to the various areas of information."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍使用 Mission Planner 飞行数据（DATA）界面各项功能所需的相关信息——通过 Mission Planner "
"顶部菜单选择。:ref:`功能简介 <mission-planner-ground-control-station>` 提供了各区域信息的简要概述。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:12
#: ce4dab05f1534a90b408d272afa293cf
msgid "Heads Up Area  (HUD)"
msgstr "平视显示区域（HUD）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:13
#: cb56d14b36804411b84761ca993a69c5
msgid ""
"This is the area in the upper left corner of the Mission Planner Data "
"screen. Details of what each item is can be found :ref:`here<mission-"
"planner-ground-control-station>`"
msgstr ""
"位于 Mission Planner 数据界面的左上角。各项目的详细说明可在 :ref:`此处 <mission-planner-ground-"
"control-station>` 查阅。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:15
#: d365a8245bed402c82545b64871f2cd4
msgid ""
"You can detach the HUD to a separate window by double clicking anywhere in "
"the window. Close the window to put it back in the main Mission Planner "
"window."
msgstr "在窗口任意位置双击可将 HUD 分离为独立窗口。关闭该窗口可将其放回 Mission Planner 主窗口。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:18
#: 35c17471da384b36bf2634571ba0f685
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:19
#: d043dc0d4a6244209e086b10354987c9
msgid "Several Options are available by right-clicking the HUD."
msgstr "右键单击 HUD 可使用多种选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:29
#: 6cd42bc3418c446a8607da985dce3924
msgid "Video:"
msgstr "视频："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:24
#: c6b0fa921d074ebf946b542418b6a141
msgid ""
"You can start or stop recording the HUD as an .avi video stored in the logs "
"folder."
msgstr "可开始或停止将 HUD 录制为 .avi 视频，视频保存在日志文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:25
#: f199daa8973544b484a56dd6a3368112
msgid ""
"Set MJPEG Source: Connect and display MJPEG video source from the network."
msgstr "设置 MJPEG 源：连接并显示来自网络的 MJPEG 视频源。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:26
#: f3ceb707c3ce4022839c58a6159fd24c
msgid ""
"Start Camera: If a video source has been selected in the CONFIG/Planner "
"page, start displaying it in the HUD window."
msgstr "启动摄像头：如果已在「CONFIG/Planner」页面中选择视频源，则在 HUD 窗口中开始显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:27
#: 3a963d849aa74467a9911db3a2b269fa
msgid "Set GStreamer Source: Connect and display Gstreamer video stream."
msgstr "设置 GStreamer 源：连接并显示 GStreamer 视频流。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:28
#: 77b63e3eaffe4d4d88e447a61d63c013
msgid ""
"HereLink Video: Display HereLink video, use the same IP as when connecting "
"MP via UDPCL to Herelink for telemetry. See Herelink documentation."
msgstr ""
"HereLink 视频：显示 HereLink 视频，使用通过 UDPCL 连接 MP 到 Herelink 时的相同 IP（用于数传）。请参阅 "
"Herelink 文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:29
#: 38206abb0acb486783a5faf04ca04216
msgid "GStreamer Stop: Stop GStreamer video."
msgstr "停止 GStreamer：停止 GStreamer 视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:31
#: e1fe03584ff144e69fa386b98d5ca8bf
msgid ""
"In the CONFIG/Planner screen, you can select to display video from a capture"
" source on the PC in the HUD window, and have the HUD display overlaid or "
"not on that video."
msgstr "在「CONFIG/Planner」界面中，可选择在 HUD 窗口中显示 PC 上的采集视频源，并设置 HUD 显示是否叠加在该视频上。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:33
#: b7a3c9b40e9e4e27964805874cd810fd
msgid ""
"Set Aspect Ratio: clicking this alternates between 4:1 and 16:9 aspect "
"ratio."
msgstr "设置宽高比：点击可在 4:1 和 16:9 宽高比之间切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:34
#: c00d5beffb67490d85226a77aa4759cc
msgid ""
"User Items: You can add any of the telemetry parameters to the display by "
"right-clicking on the HUD, clicking User Items, and checking the items you "
"want to display. Note that you can also view all of the telemetry in the "
"Control and Status area by clicking the Status button. If Scripting is "
"sending NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT values, these will also appear as an item that you"
" can display in the HUD."
msgstr ""
"用户项目：右键单击 HUD，点击「User "
"Items」并勾选所需条目，即可将任何数传参数添加到显示中。注意，也可通过点击「Status」按钮在控制和状态区域查看所有数传数据。如果脚本正在发送 "
"NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT 值，这些值也会作为可在 HUD 中显示的条目出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:35
#: 838e5f2479044107954c2e29c9c999d4
msgid ""
"Russian HUD: Toggle to/from a Russian style HUD (i.e. ground horizon fixed)."
msgstr "俄式 HUD：切换至/从俄式 HUD 样式（即地平线固定）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:36
#: d2a8ad5b1e344097afbdddb2f631bc67
msgid "Swap with Map: swap map to this window and vice versa."
msgstr "与地图互换：将地图与此窗口互换位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:37
#: 02db850e50474ded9f75827f2da0ead0
msgid "Ground Color: Click to change the ground color."
msgstr "地面颜色：点击以更改地面颜色。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:38
#: 4d0d9eb0a11f49c8a49c405792ef353f
msgid ""
"HUD Items: Toggle which items are displaying on the HUD such as heading, "
"speed, altitude, etc."
msgstr "HUD 项目：切换 HUD 上显示的项目，例如航向、速度、高度等。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:39
#: 379c526f22594fefa692773cdc2a6218
msgid ""
"Show icons/text: Toggle between using icons or text for the lower HUD items "
"such as battery capacity, EKF status, VIBE status, and GPS status."
msgstr "显示图标/文字：在图标与文字之间切换，用于 HUD 底部项目的显示，例如电池容量、EKF 状态、振动状态和 GPS 状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:42
#: 86fe4d95398f4215ad59c2e76fb3b889
msgid "Control and Status (Lower Left)"
msgstr "控制与状态区域（左下角）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:43
#: 21fb936003834d5688b53fdcf59a4524
msgid ""
"The Control and Status area of the Flight Data screen is in the lower left-"
"hand portion of Mission Planner. In this area, you can select any of several"
" different tabs. Some tabs provide information (e.g. Status) and other items"
" allow control of the vehicle (e.g. Actions) using the telemetry uplink. "
"(Telemetry radio connection is required)"
msgstr ""
"飞行数据界面的控制与状态区域位于 Mission Planner "
"的左下方。在此区域可选择多个不同的选项卡，部分选项卡提供信息（如「Status」），其他则允许通过数传上行链路控制飞行器（如「Actions」）。（需要数传无线电连接）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:45
#: c7adf770c4734631ae83d6649ba3afa4
msgid ""
"Quick:  This allows a quick look at just a few telemetry values in large "
"text.  Double-click to add items. Right-click to change the number of "
"rows/columns and move the tab to a separate window."
msgstr "Quick（快速查看）：以大字体显示少量数传数值。双击可添加项目。右键单击可更改行/列数，并将选项卡移至独立窗口。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:58
#: bb09617b41a94048a2fa6277752bd6b3
msgid ""
"Actions: Use this area to control your Auto Pilot either for testing (using "
"USB and no motor battery) or for controlling your vehicle. You can switch "
"modes, arm/disarm (while on the ground), enable an attached joystick, "
"restart a mission in the air, control a camera mount, etc."
msgstr ""
"Actions（操作）：在此区域可控制飞控，用于测试（使用 USB "
"且不接电机电池）或控制飞行器。可切换飞行模式、解锁/上锁（在地面时）、启用已连接的摇杆、在空中重启任务、控制摄像头云台等。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:47
#: 71c6a3e56c1a48679a594d1cd71f3784
msgid ""
"The dropdown menus on the left are for (in order from top to bottom) "
"choosing a MAVLink action, choosing a waypoint to set, choosing a mode to "
"set, and choosing the state of the camera mount. The buttons directly to the"
" right of each dropdown send the selected action to the connected vehicle."
msgstr ""
"左侧的下拉菜单从上到下依次用于：选择 MAVLink "
"操作、选择要设置的航点、选择要切换的飞行模式，以及选择摄像头云台状态。每个下拉菜单右侧的按钮用于将所选操作发送至已连接的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:48
#: 6ed103589f26433281a32be49c1df0bc
msgid "There are shortcut buttons for Auto, Loiter, and RTL modes"
msgstr "Auto、Loiter 和 RTL 模式有快捷按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:49
#: e6ea3482d7bb4977936517e0a06ef6fd
msgid ""
"Joystick: Allows the user to set up a joystick attached to the ground "
"station. See :ref:`common-joystick` for more information."
msgstr "Joystick（摇杆）：允许用户设置连接到地面站的摇杆。详细信息请参阅 :ref:`common-joystick`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:50
#: 81a122d21f8b4c5caec6fae83395d4e3
msgid "Set Home Alt: Set current altitude to zero"
msgstr "设置 Home 高度：将当前高度设为零"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:51
#: e9ae9f91ad89412a9f834ba7e077e19f
msgid ""
"Restart Mission: Set the current waypoint to the start of the current "
"mission"
msgstr "重启任务：将当前航点设为当前任务的起始点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:52
#: 6f9e210a8d7847c2b3d94ce461b97957
msgid ""
"Raw Sensor View: Shows roll, pitch, and yaw angles. Also shows gyro, "
"accelerometer, 8 RC input channels, and 8 servo output channels."
msgstr "原始传感器视图：显示横滚、俯仰和偏航角，以及陀螺仪、加速度计、8 路 RC 输入通道和 8 路舵机输出通道的数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:53
#: 01d492d6dad742c6a9cf0840e8ddbe4d
msgid "Arm/Disarm: Arm and disarm the vehicle."
msgstr "解锁/上锁：对飞行器进行解锁和上锁操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:54
#: 1f08608e273544438ea48e9d591ae4af
msgid "Resume Mission: Change to Auto mode at the previous waypoint."
msgstr "恢复任务：切换到 Auto 模式并从上一个航点继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:55
#: 80bf139f5eff4092a6e2b6048a09a7ad
msgid ""
"Change Speed: This value is always in m/s and performs a DO_CHANGE_SPEED "
"command"
msgstr "更改速度：该值始终以 m/s 为单位，执行 DO_CHANGE_SPEED 命令"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:56
#: 7b98405e70eb44ffbded3a38cd1f9c3c
msgid ""
"Change Alt: This value is in the user-selected altitude units. The default "
"units are meters."
msgstr "更改高度：该值使用用户选择的高度单位，默认单位为米。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:57
#: a7e7cf6e1c324dd7b0f9ce984b5f9b4d
msgid ""
"Set Loiter Rad: This changes the loiter radius when in Loiter mode in "
"meters."
msgstr "设置盘旋半径：更改 Loiter 模式下的盘旋半径，单位为米。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:58
#: 7abb8d5c716d4967b93f82810970ab00
msgid "Clear Track: Clears the purple track line shown on the map."
msgstr "清除轨迹：清除地图上显示的紫色飞行轨迹线。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:59
#: 120d5e5e54544ee296a73195513dd04f
msgid "Abort Landing: Commands the vehicle-specific abort landing procedure."
msgstr "中止降落：发出飞行器特定的中止降落程序指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:60
#: 6482abf107e846629cd138f668f2dfec
msgid ""
"Messages: Messages from the vehicle that can range in importance from "
"informational to critical. Important messages also appear on the HUD."
msgstr "Messages（消息）：来自飞行器的消息，重要程度从提示到紧急不等。重要消息也会显示在 HUD 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:61
#: 3264147c0de64857ad35401ea3e2b947
msgid ""
"Gauges: This shows four popular telemetry gauges. Double click the speed "
"gauge to change the top speed."
msgstr "Gauges（仪表）：显示四个常用数传仪表。双击速度仪表可更改最大速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:62
#: e13a4ad7185c4f65bdb8d136a597ace6
msgid ""
"Status: Clicking the Status menu button will display all of the telemetry "
"parameters"
msgstr "Status（状态）：点击「Status」菜单按钮将显示所有数传参数"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:63
#: 7334cf8eb71d4f158810d7649f6b1117
msgid ""
"Servos/Relay: This allows the setting of any relay pins or "
"setting/overriding RC values for channels 5 thru 14. (Use servo settings "
"with caution, you could change flight modes)"
msgstr ""
"Servos/Relay（舵机/继电器）：允许设置任意继电器引脚，或设置/覆盖通道 5 至 14 的 RC "
"数值。（使用舵机设置时请谨慎，可能会改变飞行模式）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:64
#: db1a0bd2bdb147b0a1e2d1771ece99c4
msgid ""
":ref:`Telemetry Logs <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs>`:  Use this "
"section to view, analyze, convert, and playback telemetry logs that are "
"recorded by Mission Planner. See :ref:`Playing Back Missions with Tlogs "
"<common-recording-and-playing-back-missions>` for specifics on playing back "
"your mission and viewing the mission in the map area."
msgstr ""
":ref:`数传日志 <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs>`：使用此部分查看、分析、转换和回放由 "
"Mission Planner 录制的数传日志。有关回放任务和在地图区域查看任务的具体操作，请参阅 :ref:`使用 Tlog 回放任务 "
"<common-recording-and-playing-back-missions>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:65
#: 54021a3f0e694de59a94209893278053
msgid ""
"Data Flash Logs:  This provides a means to download data flash logs, analyze"
" them, or create KML/gpx files from them. Click Review a Log to open a log "
"file and establish a new window to view/analyze the log. Details :ref:`here "
"<common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>`."
msgstr ""
"DataFlash 日志：提供下载 DataFlash 日志、分析日志或从日志生成 KML/gpx 文件的功能。点击「Review a "
"Log」可打开日志文件，并在新窗口中查看/分析日志。详情请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-"
"data-logs-in-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:66
#: 23e2f4c9fa3b46f2929dcdce8fee2b7a
msgid ""
":ref:`Scripts: <using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner>`: Automation using "
"Python scripts and vehicle state"
msgstr ""
":ref:`脚本 <using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner>`：使用 Python "
"脚本和飞行器状态进行自动化操作"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:68
#: 1fef6ac138ef4537a2fb8bb751fe428b
msgid ""
"the ability to change modes from the ground station can be restricted, by "
"mode, using the :ref:`FLTMODE_GCSBLOCK<FLTMODE_GCSBLOCK>` parameter."
msgstr "可通过 :ref:`FLTMODE_GCSBLOCK<FLTMODE_GCSBLOCK>` 参数限制从地面站按飞行模式切换飞行模式的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:71
#: 9076dfb0b92040fd8b8bbb5f46d13366
msgid "Map Area"
msgstr "地图区域"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:72
#: c0bdacf7b22e40ae8343ce386347d508
msgid ""
"The map area on the right side of the Flight Data screen displays the "
"vehicle track as it moves, provides other information, and allows the user "
"to enter some control actions - which send commands to the vehicle "
"(telemetry required)"
msgstr ""
"飞行数据界面右侧的地图区域会显示飞行器移动时的飞行轨迹，提供其他信息，并允许用户输入一些控制操作——这些操作将向飞行器发送指令（需要数传连接）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:74
#: c8893901bbbb42e59039a7e28a9f55e8
msgid "Right-click on the map area to select one of these options."
msgstr "在地图区域右键单击可选择以下选项之一。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:79
#: 3591b8322ba647b4b6aacf12fc3a0ac8
msgid ""
"Fly to here: (Command) This is guided mode  (see bottom of this page "
":ref:`Guided Mode <mission-planner-ground-control-station>`)"
msgstr ""
"飞往此处：（指令）这是引导模式（参见本页底部 :ref:`引导模式 <mission-planner-ground-control-station>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:80
#: 8d3fbde3045640bc8c64d498749f1beb
msgid "Fly to here Alt:  (Command) Lets you enter an altitude."
msgstr "以指定高度飞往此处：（指令）允许您输入高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:81
#: fc38423817c54dd7af6da305c0e01a78
msgid "Fly to Coords: (Command) Lets you fly to a latitude and longitude"
msgstr "飞往坐标：（指令）允许您飞往指定的纬度和经度位置"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:82
#: 02f472e6707a41e98fa229308277b2d3
msgid ""
"Add POI: Lets you set, delete, save, and load Points of Interest to display "
"on the map"
msgstr "添加兴趣点：允许在地图上设置、删除、保存和加载兴趣点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:83
#: d29fa734eee44cf7bdc9e1af9d2c5113
msgid ""
"Point Camera Here: (Command) Points vehicle and camera at the location of "
"the cursor"
msgstr "将摄像头指向此处：（指令）将飞行器和摄像头对准光标所在位置"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:84
#: ac34012d8e664cf48a4aa8e4e9e41145
msgid ""
"Point Camera Coords: (Command) Point vehicle and camera at a location using "
"latitude and longitude coordinates"
msgstr "按坐标指向摄像头：（指令）通过输入纬度和经度坐标将飞行器和摄像头指向指定位置"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:85
#: 60d90fe1fb0e4ecc97a300a7a2c5d26e
msgid ""
"Trigger Camera Now  (Command): Triggers camera if :ref:`setup <common-"
"camera-shutter-with-servo>`."
msgstr ""
"立即触发摄像头（指令）：若已 :ref:`设置 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` 摄像头快门，则触发拍摄。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-data.rst:86
#: 49bba8fa9a6e4b78b56d1c4e90b9f3e7
msgid ""
"Flight Planner:  You can open the flight planner window in the map window "
"area and leave the rest of the Flight Data Screen as is. Click the \"CLOSE\""
" button at top to return."
msgstr "飞行规划器：可在地图窗口区域内打开飞行规划窗口，同时保留其余飞行数据界面不变。点击顶部的「CLOSE」按钮可返回。"

